OL,3,GNEWSAFive held in slavery probe linked
OL,4,Ato massage parlour
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people have been arrested as part
OL,7,Fof an investigation into slavery and
OL,8,Fhuman trafficking in Leicester.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said a man and a
OL,11,Fwoman ` both 37 ` had been arrested on
OL,12,Fsuspicion of controlling prostitution
OL,13,Ffor gain and drugs offences after a
OL,14,Fwarrant was executed at an address in
OL,15,FHinckley Road on Wednesday.
OL,17,FThe man, who has been released on bail,
OL,18,Fwas also arrested on suspicion of
OL,19,Farranging or facilitating travel of
OL,20,Fanother person with a view to
OL,21,Fexploitation.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
